with affine transition morphisms. Assume
\begin{enumerate}
\item $Y$ quasi-compact and quasi-separated,
\item $X_i$ quasi-compact and quasi-separated,
\item $X \to Y$ affine.
\end{enumerate}
Then $X_i \to Y$ is affine for $i$ large enough.

